MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_001: You know me as Anna, the administrator of the\nHeroic Games, but my job today is a little different.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_002: You seem like a skilled warrior, so I have a favor to\nask if you're willing to listen.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_003: By the way, Queen Theodora, because this job is a\nsecret, and you never know who's listening...
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_004: I might sound a little more casual than you're used to.\nBut trust me, there's good reason for it.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_005: <NCA>Hear her out.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_006: <NCB>Decline the request.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_007: <ACA>Great! Then we can get straight to the details.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_008: <ACB>Aw, don't be like that! At least let me tell you what\nthe favor is about.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_009: There was an old worship site on the outskirts of\nDagsion once. What's left of it is half buried now.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_010: It was abandoned long ago. With no one keeping\nthe place in good shape, it fell into ruin.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_011: But now I hear someone's been poking around it\nwithout permission. I need to find out why.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_012: But I'd rather not go alone, and you seem like the\nperfect backup!
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m01_013: What do you think? Are you in?
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m03_001: Now, fair warning, there might be some danger.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m03_002: Which is why I'm willing to pay generously for it.\nNot a bad deal, right?
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m03_003: If you're in, come find me when you have the time.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m04_001: I need to poke around the ruins of an old worship site\non the outskirts of Dagsion.
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m04_002: What do you think? Are you in?
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m04_No: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_08_m04_007: Fair enough! But if you change your mind, come find\nme. I'll keep my fingers crossed!